.cpp` on AMD GPUs.

*   **Target Base:** `llama.cpp` at commit `790cf51aa` (re-based as of **2026-09-13**).
*   **Target Hardware:**
    *   **RDNA 3:** `gfx1100` (e.g1.10.720.896 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    194, tg =  30.34 t/s, tg_3s =  30.93 t/s
., RX 7900 XTX/XT, 7800 XT)
