### 🔑 Key Features & Capabilities

#### 1. Performance Accelerations
*   **WMMA Flash-Attention:** Native BF16 Flash-Attention using Wave Matrix Multiply Accumulate (WMMA)1.16.469.569 I sched_graph_realloc: graph reallocation: nodes = 5217 (changed = 0), splits = 50, n_same = 8, n_diff = 0
